o-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인재를 양성하기 위하여 생활과 교육을 결합한 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">RC</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">제도를 시행하고자 합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">RC</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육은 생활관에 거주하며 정규 교과의 학습활동과 다양한 비교과프로그램을 통해 핵심역량을 개발하는 프로그램입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대학 내 교수와 선배 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년으로 구성된 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">RC House</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">에 소속되며 상담</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">튜터링 등으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년이 쉽게 대학생활에 적응하고 진로를 탐색하도록 돕는 것을 목표로 하고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">이에 따라 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기로 복학하는 학생 중에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 금오공과대학교 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">RC </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육프로그램의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\